        confinement bundle `v/Λ`, unconditional (`oneOverConfBundle_eq_ratio`, `oneOverConfBundle_eq_exp`);
    (2) THE REDUCTION: from the two Born-square anchor pinnings (up at `M·ewClosureRatio`, floor at
        `M·confinementScaleRatio`), `(Mu/Mlam)^2 = 1/confBundle` with the anchor `M` cancelling
        (`huc_from_born_anchors`); the floor half is definitional (`confAnchor_is_confScale`);
    (3) MIS-POWER (iii) EXCLUDED — the Born-square is LINEAR (rung once), `1/confBundle ≠
        1/confBundle^2` (`huc_not_mispower`, `mispower_strictly_above`);
    (4) DOUBLE-COUNT (ii) REFUTED — the light-edge rung IS the band rung as ONE derived object
        (`rung_is_one_object`), the colour/space gap `8π/3 = 12π − 28π/3` of the ONE 84π budget
        (`rung_is_gap`) — ONE CAUSE in two censuses, not two independent rungs;
    (5) so READING (i) is FORCED and the reduction is non-vacuous (`born_anchors_satisfiable`,
        `huc_anchor_independent`).

    ⚠ HONEST GRADE: (1)–(5) THEOREM-EXACT now. The confinement-floor anchor half is definitional; the
    up-sector top-at-anchor Born-square pinning `Mu^2 = M·ewClosureRatio` is ROUTE-NOT-YET-FOUND, the
    DIRECTED SUCCESSOR of this campaign node. NO-FIT: measured `1/α(0)`, `Λ_QCD`, PDG masses are
    REMOVABLE PROSE; no empirical number in any statement or proof. -/
theorem hucBornSquareAnchor_landing (M Mu Mlam : Cut) (hM : M ≠ 0)
    (hu : Mu ^ 2 = M * ewClosureRatio)
    (hl : Mlam ^ 2 = M * confinementScaleRatio) :
    -- (1) 1/confBundle unconditionally
    ((1 : Cut) / confBundle = ewClosureRatio / confinementScaleRatio)
    ∧ ((1 : Cut) / confBundle = cutExp (8 * cutPi / 3))
    -- (2) the reduction: huc forced, M cancelling; floor half definitional
    ∧ ((Mu / Mlam) ^ 2 = 1 / confBundle)
    ∧ (M * confinementScaleRatio = confinementScale M)
    -- (3) mis-power excluded
    ∧ ((1 : Cut) / confBundle ≠ 1 / confBundle ^ 2)
    -- (4) double-count refuted: ONE object, the gap of the ONE budget
    ∧ (cutLog ((1 : Cut) / confBundle) = 8 * cutPi / 3
        ∧ cutLog ((1 : Cut) / confBundle) = cutLog confBandRatio)
    ∧ ((8 * cutPi / 3 : Cut) = 12 * cutPi - 28 * cutPi / 3) :=
  ⟨oneOverConfBundle_eq_ratio,
   oneOverConfBundle_eq_exp,
   huc_from_born_anchors M Mu Mlam hM hu hl,
   confAnchor_is_confScale M,
   huc_not_mispower,
   rung_is_one_object,
   rung_is_gap⟩

end

